  "reading": "The model chi-square is the guideline-informed RAG chatbot against the other three. Clustering recommendations inside the response cannot remove it: the required design effect is about 51, and the maximum within-response design effect is 8.3. Pairwise tests among ChatGPT, Gemini and DeepSeek are already non-significant or marginal before any correction. The frame and cupping chi-squares shrink, and they lose p < 0.05 only if recommendations inside a response are nearly duplicates. They are not: a cupping-sheet answer mixes several accurate lines with about one inaccurate cupping line."
